### 9.4 Numerical checks performed on the custom code

* `src/mech_text.py`: round-trip regeneration of the parent is byte-identical in species,
  reactions, forward rate constants and h/RT (`results/_rt.yaml` vs `parent.yaml`).
* `src/obs2.py`: cross-checked against the single-diagnostic solver `src/obs.py` on ten
  conditions (`results/obs2_check.json`): ratios 0.999-1.085; the grid-refinement effect is
  0.06-0.27 % at 400 vs 120 points, and the earlier grid-quantisation defect (three different
  mixtures returning the identical delay) is documented in section 6.
* `src/check_integrity.py`: for every mechanism in the two families, thermodynamics and
  transport are compared coefficient-by-coefficient with the parent, forward rate constants
  of the kept reactions are compared, third-body efficiency maps are compared, elemental
  balance of every reaction is checked, and the number of duplicate equations is checked not
  to exceed the parent's.
* `src/archive_unit_audit.py`: independent recomputation of the unit/species/composition
  consistency of all 1094 archive files.
